@startuml
actor "Simulatore (Calciobalilla)" as Sim
participant "Mosquitto Broker\n(Local)" as MQTT
participant "BitPub Edge\n(Local App)" as Edge
database "H2/SQLite\n(Edge DB)" as DBEdge
participant "API Gateway\n(Cloud)" as Gateway
participant "Match Service\n(Cloud)" as Match
participant "Notification Service\n(Cloud)" as Notification
actor "Web App / Kiosk\n(Client)" as Client

== Fase 1: Generazione Evento e Inoltro Edge ==
Sim -> MQTT: Publish: topic `locale/1/machine/123/events/goal`\n(Payload: {team: "A", time: ...})
MQTT -> Edge: Riceve evento in Sottoscrizione
Edge -> Edge: Valida l'evento e arricchisce i metadati
Edge -> DBEdge: Salva evento (Offline buffer)

== Fase 2: Sincronizzazione Cloud ==
Edge -> Gateway: POST /api/v1/matches/123/events (Event JSON)
Gateway -> Match: Inoltra richiesta (con JWT validato o ApiKey Edge)

Match -> Match: Processa l'evento (Aggiorna punteggio)
Match -> DBEdge: (Nel Cloud): Persiste stato partita su Postgres

== Fase 3: Notifica Real-time ==
Match -> Notification: Publish: MatchUpdateEvent (RabbitMQ/Kafka o HTTP)
Notification -> Client: Push tramite WebSocket/SSE (Aggiornamento UI)
Client -> Client: Aggiorna punteggio a schermo (Kiosk/Web App)

== Conferma Sincronizzazione (Ack) ==
Match --> Gateway: 201 Created
Gateway --> Edge: 201 Created
Edge -> DBEdge: Marca l'evento come "SYNCED" o rimuove dal buffer

@enduml
